<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Jan  17.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Jan  17.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Friday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at the close was 3422.35, 33.53 points or 0.97 percent lower than Thursday's close.</p>
